<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Your OTA is ready</title>
  </head>
  <body style="margin: 0; padding: 24px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; color: #1f2933; background-color: #ffffff;">
    <p>Hello {{fullName}},</p>
    <p>Your OTA {{tenantName}} ({{tenantKey}}) is set up and ready. Its test API keys and its storefront are waiting for you in the portal.</p>
